      "notes": "Use only ultra-purified fish oils, free of mercury and other heavy metals"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Share our profits to help people locally and around the world\nWe're glad you're giving us a try & feel pretty good that you'll try us again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Other",
      "notes": "3x better absorption\nOur special emulsified formula is absorbed better than traditional fish oil or softgels, so you get more of the Omega-3s your body needs.\nSweet taste & creamy texture"
